This is an isolated smoke test post for Pages CMS compatibility verification.

## Purpose

The purpose of this fixture is to verify:

1. YAML frontmatter parsing and preservation.
2. Directory structure retention under content/posts/test-smoke-post/index.mdoc.
3. Strict draft status isolation so this content does not appear in production static export.

## Verification

When built via npm run build, this article must remain private and excluded from public blog lists and route generation.
